---
layout: layouts/landing.njk
title: Blog
description: Field notes from Eureka. How trades businesses are growing — and how the dumb ones are still losing money on ads.
permalink: /blog/
hasContactForm: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Field notes from the trades-marketing trenches.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">Practical breakdowns of what’s working in trades marketing right now — and the expensive mistakes we keep seeing. Written for owner-operators, not marketers.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {% set posts = collections.post | reverse %}
    {% if posts.length %}
      <ul class="post-list">
        {% for post in posts %}
          <li>
            <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
              <div class="post-card__meta">
                <span>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
                {% if post.data.author %}<span>· {{ post.data.author }}</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              <h2 class="post-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
              <p class="post-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ps__empty">
        <div class="ps__empty-icon">// No posts yet</div>
        <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px;">Drop a markdown file in <code>src/pages/blog/</code> and it’ll show up here.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-block.njk" %}
